1
00:00:04,796 --> 00:00:06,836
It's 2 a.m. What are you doing up?

2
00:00:07,048 --> 00:00:11,848
(Sheldon:)Nobel Prize acceptance ceremony
streaming live from Stockholm.

3
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:16,179
Sure. Wanna see what all the scientists
are wearing this year.

4
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:18,647
(Sheldon:)Look at these men.

5
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:21,692
(Sheldon:)They've managed to win
the top science prize in the world...

6
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:24,777
(Sheldon:)...with no more understanding
of the quantum underpinnings...

7
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:28,193
(Sheldon:)...of the expansion of the early universe
than God gave a goose.

8
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:34,117
(Sheldon:)You should pay attention, Leonard.
Someday it's gonna be you up there.

9
00:00:35,327 --> 00:00:38,037
(Leonard:)- Thanks.
- So, what's got you up?

10
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:40,666
(Sheldon:)Did you have a bad clam?

11
00:00:41,208 --> 00:00:43,838
- I didn't have clams.
- I don't watch you 24 hours a day.

12
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:46,004
(Sheldon:)I don't know what you do.

13
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:51,463
(Leonard:)It's this Jimmy Speckerman thing.
I can't decide if I should agree...

14
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:55,266
...to see him or not. That might be
because the last time I ran into him...

15
00:00:55,472 --> 00:00:58,312
(Leonard:)...he made me floss
with my own shoelaces.

16
00:00:59,226 --> 00:01:02,026
(Sheldon:)Wear loafers.

